%% Workflow at a glance. Rendered by hand as workflow.html (no runtime diagram library).
flowchart LR
    A[Task or issue] --> B[specify]
    B --> C{You confirm the plan}
    C -->|Revise| B
    C -->|Approve| D[implement-tests?]
    D --> E[implement]
    E --> F[review?]
    F --> G[commit-and-push?]
    G --> H[draft-pr?]
    C -->|Small change| M[implement in the same session]
